B.a3S=new A.cf("4 \u2014 Headwind","Unfactored headwind component in knots. The maximum is automatically limited to the upper boundary of the wind nomogram for the current conditions and adjusts as inputs change.",null)
B.a3R=new A.cf("Result","Height loss BTS in feet. 0 ft means conditions fall below the chart's lower boundary \u2014 no meaningful drop down is required.\n\nThe red trace shows: PA/OAT (left graph) \u2192 wind nomogram (centre) \u2192 GW curve (right graph) \u2192 height loss on the x-axis.",null)
B.a3p=new A.cf("Helideck height requirement","If a drop down is indicated, the helideck elevation above the sea (or obstacles) must exceed the computed drop down plus the clearance margin required by the Competent Authority. There must be no obstacles beyond and below the deck edge.",null)
