B.a3g=new A.cf("What is this tool?","Calculates the remaining serviceable life of the Number 1 and Number 2 starter generator brush sets, per the detailed inspection procedure (39-A-24-31-01-01A-31AA-A).",null)
B.a3m=new A.cf("Aircraft & generator identification","Optionally record the aircraft registration, each generator's serial number, and free-text comments. These are included in the shared/downloaded PDF but do not affect the calculation.",null)
B.a3D=new A.cf("1 \u2014 Measure the shortest brush","Find the shortest brush in the set and measure its length (Y). A new brush is 17.78 mm (0.7 in) long.\n\nTip: scroll wheel on the field to adjust the value.",null)
