B.a3t=new A.cf("3 \u2014 Visual checks","Tick any box that applies after examining the brush with a strong light: damaged, cracked, or seated area unsatisfactory (below 85% minimum, per detail C/D of the IETP figure). Any of these alone requires discarding the brush set.",null)
B.a3w=new A.cf("4 \u2014 Read the result","Brush wear (X) = 17.78 \u2212 Y.\nWear rate (Z) = X \xf7 T.\nServiceable life (W) = Y \xf7 Z.\n\nThe brush set is flagged for discard if any visual check is ticked, or if the calculated serviceable life is below 150 hours.",null)
B.a3o=new A.cf("5 \u2014 Share PDF","Once at least one generator has valid inputs, download/share buttons appear. They generate a PDF report with both generators' results.",null)
B.a3T=new A.cf("Safety","Always refer to up-to-date official AW139 maintenance publications before performing any maintenance action. This tool is for reference only.",null)
